WEBVTT

00:55:29.481 --> 00:55:33.259
that a fulfilling life is spent
watching "Game of Thrones."

00:55:33.283 --> 00:55:34.770
CA: But part of the problem is,

00:55:34.794 --> 00:55:37.937
people don't have to think that people's
reflective minds can know

00:55:37.961 --> 00:55:39.605
that that's not the best thing,

00:55:39.629 --> 00:55:43.932
but in the moment, the power of
a lot of these magnets is pretty intense.

00:55:43.956 --> 00:55:46.239
People may not say,
"This is what I want to do,"

00:55:46.263 --> 00:55:48.522
but people are addicted,

00:55:48.546 --> 00:55:52.703
and whether it's to technology
or to opioids or to whatever it is,

00:55:52.727 --> 00:55:55.558
these addictions have
a pretty toxic effect.

00:55:55.582 --> 00:55:57.827
DB: Yeah, the ancient word is "idolatry."

00:55:57.851 --> 00:55:59.425
So, we idolize certain things

00:55:59.449 --> 00:56:01.770
that we think will give us
ultimate satisfaction,